      "text": "PETSAFE · DTC OPS & INSIGHTS REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "t": "h1",
      "text": "The stack is right. The signals aren't."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "JSON-LD blocks on the homepage"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The stack is right, the signals aren’t: /sitemap.xml returns homepage HTML, llms.txt is missing, and every product page ships the same 15-word meta description."
