    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Three things\nthe review found"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Quoted from the full review. Each one carries its date, source and a fix inside."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Structured data is silent on the front door"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Homepage carries no JSON-LD; interior product pages carry ProductGroup, BreadcrumbList and hand-curated FAQPage. The gap is only at the top of the funnel."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Sitemap and llms.txt need owners"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "curl https://www.petsafe.com/sitemap.xml returns 200 with Content-Type: text/html. A specialist who owns URL taxonomy owns this — the fix is one build-time step."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "The stack for Tableau is already emitting events"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "GTM is live, Klaviyo is firing, Shopify is behind the cart, Triple Whale is watching spend, Bazaarvoice is collecting reviews. Tableau dashboards described in the JD can be built on top of what's already flowing, not from scratch."
    },
